{"id":"steam-823350","steam":823350,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"HELL'S NEW WORLD","summary":"ENTER HELL and experience blood and torment the way God intended. Use shotguns, rocket launchers, and more to spread the joy of suffering to your friends and loved ones.","about":"BLOOD, BONES, BRAINS, AND OTHER FAN FAVORITES \n\r\nWelcome to Hell, enjoy your stay. Fight and kill faster than they can fight and kill you. \r\n\r\nHELL'S NEW WORLD is a fast and blood-fueled multiplayer retro FPS experience. The goal is to provide a fun and welcoming experience for new players to the Arena FPS genre, while still providing a pure and familiar, yet unique experience for veteran players. Join a community who is excited to help and teach, as well as offer a good challenge.\r\n\r\n\nKICK ASS MUSIC\n\r\nSpill blood while listening to the atmospheric and violent D&B OST by Necto Ulin.\r\n\r\n\nCUSTOM MAPS\n\r\nCreate custom maps and share them on the Steam Workshop. Use the power of Unreal Engine 4 to create anything you desire.\r\n\r\n\nCUSTOM GAMEPLAY\n\r\nCreate your own gameplay mutators and load them ingame without restarting the match. Whether you want to use a simple and easy-to-use interface to adjust nearly any property of any object in the game, or you want to write advanced Lua scripts, the possibilities to create Custom Fun™ are endless.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823350/library_600x900.jpg?t=1635461008","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823350/header.jpg?t=1635461008","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823350/library_hero.jpg?t=1635461008","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823350/header.jpg?t=1635461008","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823350/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1635461008","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta